Ported from dsh-apollo
---------------------
Portions of this package (the Codex/Claude CLI protocol adapters, JSONL
parsing, the durable identity KV, the CLI routing bridge, the read-only
capability/model APIs, and the row-config settings form) are adapted from
dsh-apollo (npm: @menghuan1918/dsh-apollo,
https://github.com/Menghuan1918/dsh-apollo), which is licensed under
GPL-3.0-or-later. Copyright (C) 2026 Menghuan1918. The subagent CLI route ids,
the `apollo_cli_<sha256(profile.dir)[:16]>` KV namespace and the stored record
shape are kept for compatibility and are not a new contract.

Trust-fence boundary logic
--------------------------
The `/better-subagent/api/*` request trust boundary (loopback hostname check,
trustedHosts comparison, cross-site rejection, same-origin Origin check) is
adapted from the trust-fence boundary used by dsh-better-sidebar
(https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar) and the api-request-trust /
loopback-hostname helpers of @deepseek-ai/dsh-client-connection, both under the
MIT License. The logic was reimplemented here without importing either package.

